Fix demonstrable input-handling problems within this feature’s scope.

Do not turn every unavailable move into a queued action.

Do not make techniques, summons, Shield or movement requests automatically execute much later unless their existing system explicitly supports buffering.

Avoid speculative combat rebalancing.

If an issue would require changing the game’s fundamental combat design, document it separately rather than silently introducing a new rule.

30. Improve clarity without cluttering the battlefield

