* The original attack’s cooldown starts once.

Test group C — Input mashing and holding

* Holding Attack 1 generates no additional queued attack.
* Holding Attack 2 generates no additional queued attack.
* Repeatedly pressing Attack 1 many times during one attack queues only one follow-up.
