Test group E — Cooldown integrity

* Attack 2 on cooldown cannot execute as a queued follow-up.
* Attack 1 on cooldown cannot execute as a queued follow-up.
* The original move’s cooldown remains correct.
* The alternate move’s cooldown remains correct.
* Longer cooldowns remain intact.
* Queues never shorten timers.
* Unavailable moves are discarded without retrying forever.
* No global cooldown is introduced.
